{"id":"56c1f813209c75e1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-satisfaction.md","title":"First-Order Satisfaction","display":"df-first-order-satisfaction — First-Order Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","aliases":["93-df-first-order-satisfaction"],"display":"df-first-order-satisfaction — First-Order Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-structure]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-satisfaction — First-Order Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0ce709e0d2857990\" href=\"?note=0ce709e0d2857990\" title=\"93-df-first-order-structure\">93-df-first-order-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\to A\">\\(s:\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\to A\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span>, the tagged constructor <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{App}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{App}_{93}\\)</span>, and the explicit tuple map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is a mnemonic sort tag.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[a/x]\">\\(s[a/x]\\)</span> is the assignment update, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}\\)</span> is term evaluation, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}\\)</span> is the recursively characterized satisfaction relation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Local, universal-assignment, theory, and tuple satisfaction notations are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>更新赋值中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>；递归项求值中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\">\\(\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f)}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\ns[a/x]\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(s\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times A)\\bigr)\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\ns[a/x]\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(s\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times A)\\bigr)\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq s(x)&amp;&amp; (x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))&amp;\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigl(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s},\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f),\\bar t\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n&amp;&amp; (f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq s(x)&amp;&amp; (x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(\\operatorname{App}_{93}(f,\\bar t))&amp;\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigl(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s},\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm f}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(f),\\bar t\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n&amp;&amp; (f\\in\\operatorname{Fun}_{93}(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\times|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t\\doteq u,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(t)=\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(u)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\langle r(\\bar t),s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s},\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r),\\bar t\\bigr)\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\notin S)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land(\\langle\\varphi\\wedge\\psi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\land\\langle\\psi,s\\rangle\\in S)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle\\varphi,s[a/x]\\rangle\\in S)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\times|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle t\\doteq u,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(t)=\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s}(u)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\forall\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(\\langle r(\\bar t),s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L}_{s},\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r),\\bar t\\bigr)\n\\in r^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\notin S)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land(\\langle\\varphi\\wedge\\psi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\land\\langle\\psi,s\\rangle\\in S)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;(\\langle\\varphi,s[a/x]\\rangle\\in S)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\to\\exists!S\\;\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\to\\exists!S\\;\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\\land\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{FOSatRel}_{93}(S,\\mathfrak A;\\mathcal L)\\land\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle\\in S\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Gamma\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Gamma\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(\\bar x(i))=\\bar a(i))\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x]\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\forall s\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\;(s(\\bar x(i))=\\bar a(i))\\to\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[s]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Structural recursion yields a unique satisfaction relation. Tuple satisfaction fixes every free variable and is therefore independent of how the remaining variables are assigned.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"